url: "https://bjbeyond81.github.io/phoenix-experiment-dataset/"
abstract: >-
  Descriptive dataset of public exchanges on X (5 Aug – 14 Nov 2026, plus 2
  pre-window context rows) in which @BJ_Beyond and @BJ_hal addressed @grok and
  a Grok-generated image appeared. 56 rows, 52 Grok replies with media, 58
  unique images referenced by Post ID and SHA256 only, not redistributed.
  The 14 Nov 2026 bare-mention row (@BJ_Beyond posted only "@grok" at 12:28:50
  Europe/Rome; Grok replied at 12:30:09 with the liturgy template and an
  unrequested image) concludes the Phoenix Experiment. Post identifiers and URLs for that row are included. The image
  is not redistributed and is not among the checksums. Photos only, no denominator, small n;
  authorship of prompts is author testimony; any mechanism is a hypothesis.
keywords:
  - Phoenix Experiment
  - Grok
  - xAI
  - image generation
  - human judgment
  - Human Edge
  - ritual convergence
  - dataset
